WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.730 align:middle line:90%

2
00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:04.018 align:middle line:84%
I need to send a message out
to my team, and only my team.

3
00:00:04.018 --> 00:00:05.560 align:middle line:84%
The client involved
with this project

4
00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:07.030 align:middle line:90%
doesn't need to see it at all.

5
00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:09.250 align:middle line:84%
So I just need to
set it to private.

6
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:13.300 align:middle line:84%
Let's click Post a New
Message, give it a title,

7
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.820 align:middle line:90%
and then add some text.

8
00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:18.100 align:middle line:84%
And this is the option
I'm looking for here.

9
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.430 align:middle line:84%
I'll click Private to make
it private, only to my team.

10
00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:23.380 align:middle line:90%
And now I'll post it.

11
00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:26.050 align:middle line:84%
Notice how the red banner
here tells me it's private.

12
00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:28.720 align:middle line:84%
It's a quick glance to make
sure that the message can only

13
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.960 align:middle line:90%
be seen by my team.
